{
  "id": "milestones",
  "title": "Developmental milestones",
  "source": [
    "CDC 'Learn the Signs. Act Early.' milestone checklists, 2022 revision (Zubler JM et al., Pediatrics 2022;149(3):e2021052138): checkpoint age at which the milestone is listed.",
    "WHO Multicentre Growth Reference Study Group, Acta Paediatrica Suppl 2006;450:86-95: windows of achievement for six gross motor milestones; the upper limit of the window is used as byMonths."
  ],
  "meaning": "fromMonths = age the item starts to be asked. byMonths = age at which it is expected; a milestone not achieved at or after this age is written as a delay. Values are screening prompts, not diagnoses; review with a paediatrician before relying on them.",
